{"id":"neudacha","lemma":"неудача","pos":"noun","rank":4814,"glosses":["misfortune, mishap, bad luck, failure"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bc/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"неудачи","plural":"неудачи"},"examples":[{"text":"Это будет большая неудача.","en":"It'll be a big flop.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"big, large, great","l":"большой"},null]},{"text":"Том боялся неудачи.","en":"Tom was afraid of failure.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to fear, to be afraid","l":"бояться"},null]},{"text":"Это всего лишь маленькая неудача.","en":"It's only a minor setback.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,null,{"g":"little, small","l":"маленький"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"only, no more than"]]},{"text":"У нас будут неудачи.","en":"We're going to have failures.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Наша неудача была временной.","en":"Our bad luck was temporary.","words":[{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"time"}]}]}